    },
    {
      "end": 42.91999816894531,
      "text": "Gonna outlast you, outlasting me, I don't think that could be true",
      "start": 37.459999084472656
    },
    {
      "end": 48.880001068115234,
      "text": "Cause I know I come with the love, and I know I won't rise above our equal",
      "start": 42.939998626708984
    },
    {
      "end": 54.41999816894531,
      "text": "To bring motherfuckers with me, no treatment of evil",
      "start": 49.41999816894531
    },
    {
      "end": 64.66000366210938,
      "text": "Look, Outlast, your base, fight the breeze, fight yourself and I'll",
      "start": 54.41999816894531
    },
    {
      "end": 71.12000274658203,
      "text": "Positive, positive, who wraps around you",
      "start": 66.5999984741211
    },
    {
      "end": 74.45999908447266,
      "text": "Don't be negative, I said but it's hard to",
      "start": 71.58000183105469
    },
    {
      "end": 77.55999755859375,
      "text": "Can you show me the way, the power, we outlast",
      "start": 74.45999908447266
    },
    {
      "end": 82.86000061035156,
      "text": "3Z, I don't think so, bring your brother down",
