    },
    {
      "end": 89.0199966430664,
      "text": "Help him build a bridge, over the alliance",
      "start": 82.86000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 97.55999755859375,
      "text": "Gonna outlast it all, I made it fall in love with my name",
      "start": 89.5
    },
    {
      "end": 104.69999694824219,
      "text": "Hope you got stereo to hear my sound, just go back to the brisk",
      "start": 98.13999938964844
    },
    {
      "end": 108.45999908447266,
      "text": "I don't talk shit about you, you all got up, we all got fed",
      "start": 104.69999694824219
    },
    {
      "end": 113.86000061035156,
      "text": "We all people thinking that we're not the man, we're not one like that",
      "start": 108.45999908447266
    },
    {
      "end": 117.86000061035156,
      "text": "Self-individual love you gotta have, be autonomous",
      "start": 113.86000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 121.69999694824219,
      "text": "Don't ruin anyone else shot at the goal, yeah",
      "start": 117.86000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 124.69999694824219,
      "text": "Money brought you down, gotta outlast it",
      "start": 122.27999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 127.76000213623047,
      "text": "Hate brought you down, you gotta outlast it",
      "start": 125.27999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 130.8800048828125,
      "text": "Come true, forget what you feel",
      "start": 127.83999633789062
    },
    {
      "end": 133.83999633789062,
      "text": "I know we're all on the same deal",
      "start": 130.8800048828125
    },
    {
      "end": 138.8800048828125,
      "text": "Outlast the haters, outlast people angered",
      "start": 133.9199981689453
    },
    {
      "end": 144.4600067138672,
      "text": "Outlast me as I outlast the true crime",
      "start": 139.9600067138672
    },
    {
      "end": 148.17999267578125,
      "text": "If you don't care, if you came here with a frown",
      "start": 144.4600067138672
    },
    {
      "end": 151.5800018310547,
      "text": "I just wish you would just stay in town",
      "start": 148.17999267578125
    },
    {
      "end": 155.82000732421875,
      "text": "Recognize greatness in the sound",
      "start": 152.33999633789062
    },
    {
      "end": 158.1999969482422,
      "text": "Outlast it all",
      "start": 155.82000732421875
    },
    {
      "end": 163.94000244140625,
      "text": "I'm gonna outlast me, it's my thoughts and energy",
      "start": 158.60000610351562
    },
    {
      "end": 168.74000549316406,
      "text": "As it goes spectacularly from one point to another",
      "start": 164.82000732421875
    },
    {
      "end": 174.0399932861328,
      "text": "All across universes and a time to a university",
      "start": 168.9600067138672
    },
    {
      "end": 178.1999969482422,
      "text": "In your mind, not pinnacle to me, I can't see",
      "start": 174.0399932861328
    },
    {
      "end": 181.44000244140625,
      "text": "Progress, anyway",
      "start": 179.83999633789062
    },
    {
      "end": 187.0800018310547,
      "text": "Then again, are you even looking my way?",
      "start": 182.55999755859375
    },
    {
      "end": 191.3000030517578,
      "text": "Oh, you sleep on this",
      "start": 187.86000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 197,
      "text": "Strangers come from the abyss, took you out in the night",
      "start": 191.47999572753906
    },
    {
      "end": 201.60000610351562,
      "text": "Now there's number one outlast in the outlaster",
      "start": 197.17999267578125
    },
    {
      "end": 206.22000122070312,
      "text": "Outlooks another group famous for the deaths, deaths of all of us",
      "start": 201.77999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 209.47999572753906,
      "text": "Outlast the hate from all of you",
      "start": 206.36000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 212.16000366210938,
      "text": "I know you're hatin' right now",
      "start": 209.47999572753906
    },
    {
      "end": 215.39999389648438,
      "text": "Cause I look so fuckin' good",
      "start": 212.24000549316406
    },
    {
      "end": 217.9600067138672,
      "text": "I'll outlast all your hate",
      "start": 215.60000610351562
    },
    {
      "end": 220.97999572753906,
      "text": "I'll come back with a fire alarm",
      "start": 218.33999633789062
    },
    {
      "end": 224.8000030517578,
      "text": "Time to bake that motherfucker, here's where we came from",
      "start": 220.97999572753906
    },
    {
      "end": 228.47999572753906,
      "text": "That doesn't mean it's good, at all",
      "start": 224.82000732421875
    },
    {
      "end": 232.94000244140625,
      "text": "Uh, you have a refund policy?",
